{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o115a","title":"孙权诏议长吏奔丧科禁","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o115a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权诏议长吏奔丧科禁","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o115a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"下诏议制","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o115a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":237,"label":"嘉禾六年春正月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y237","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o115","basis":"嘉禾六年春正月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o115a-q","wuzhu-q-o115","houfei-q-o026","mingdi-q-o052","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o115a-q","source_order":[47,589,"O115a"],"order":8331}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o026","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-365be41815d34bbf6899","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年夏，有司议定七庙。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o052","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-26b7ecd6c3ecce777040","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年春（正）〔二〕月，壬辰〖1〗，山茌县言黄龙现〖2〗。﹝一﹞于是有司奏，以为魏得地统〖3〗，宜以建丑之月为正〖4〗。三月，定历改年为孟夏四月；﹝二﹞服色尚黄〖5〗；牺牲用白〖6〗；戎事乘黑首白马〖7〗，建大赤之旂〖8〗；朝会，建大白之旗。﹝三﹞改太和历曰景初历〖9〗：其春夏秋冬孟仲季月，虽与正岁不同〖10〗，至于郊祀、迎气、礿祠、蒸尝、巡狩、蒐田、分至启闭、班宣时令、中气早晚、敬授民事〖11〗，皆以正岁斗建为历数之序〖12〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":218,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o115a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b115e01f1969ebfec39b","layer":"original","quote":"六年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“夫三年之丧〖2〗，天下之达制〖3〗，人情之极痛也；贤者割哀以从礼〖4〗，不肖者勉而致之〖5〗。世治道泰，上下无事，君子不夺人情，故三年不逮孝子之门〖6〗；至于有事，则杀礼以从宜〖7〗，腰绖而处事〖8〗。故圣人制法，有礼无时则不行〖9〗。遭丧不奔，非古也；盖随时之宜，以义断恩也。前故设科：长吏在官〖10〗，当须交代〖11〗。而故犯之〖12〗；虽随纠坐〖13〗，犹已废旷〖14〗。方事之殷〖15〗，国家多难；凡在官司〖16〗，宜各尽节，先公后私：而不恭承，甚非谓也〖17〗！中外群僚，其更平议〖18〗；务令得中，详为节度。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":77,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":274,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o115","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b115e01f1969ebfec39b","layer":"original","quote":"六年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“夫三年之丧〖2〗，天下之达制〖3〗，人情之极痛也；贤者割哀以从礼〖4〗，不肖者勉而致之〖5〗。世治道泰，上下无事，君子不夺人情，故三年不逮孝子之门〖6〗；至于有事，则杀礼以从宜〖7〗，腰绖而处事〖8〗。故圣人制法，有礼无时则不行〖9〗。遭丧不奔，非古也；盖随时之宜，以义断恩也。前故设科：长吏在官〖10〗，当须交代〖11〗。而故犯之〖12〗；虽随纠坐〖13〗，犹已废旷〖14〗。方事之殷〖15〗，国家多难；凡在官司〖16〗，宜各尽节，先公后私：而不恭承，甚非谓也〖17〗！中外群僚，其更平议〖18〗；务令得中，详为节度。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":77,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":274,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
